# Usage Monitoring

- Check the current account usage before starting each tracker task.
- Check it again after major implementation and verification milestones during longer tasks.
- Tell Akhil the remaining percentage when it materially affects whether the task can be completed and verified safely.
- At 35% remaining or lower, recommend whether to finish the current task, reduce its scope, or continue in a later session.
- Never sacrifice testing, tracker updates, source control safety, or work quality merely to finish within the remaining allowance.
